sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant R as Router
    participant P as Primary
    participant S as Spillover
    C->>R: short completion
    R->>P: attempt
    P-->>R: connection error / HTTP 5xx
    R->>R: mark 15s cooldown
    R->>S: retry unchanged request
    S-->>C: streamed response + backend header
